/P 180 0 R
/T (THE SYSTEM CONTEXT DIAGRAM FOR THE MINUM'S ENT.  MANAGEMENT SYSTEM  SHOWS HOW THE SYSTEM INTERACTS WITH CUSTOMER, STAFF & MANAGER, AND GOOGLE GEMINI AI API AT THE HIGHER LEVEL. THE CUSTOMERS ARE ABLE TO LOG INTO THE MOBILE APP TO VIEW THE MENU, PLACE AN ORDER, TRACK THEIR ORDER ONLINE, AND ALSO SEND INQUIRIES THROUGH THE AI CHATBOT OR DIRECTLY TO MANAGERS. STAFF & MANAGER WILL BE INTERACTING WITH THE SYSTEM TO TAKE CARE OF THEIR ATTENDANCE, REGISTER STOCK-IN AND STOCK-OUT, EDIT MENU INFORMATION, AND VIEW REPORTS RELATED TO INVENTORY AND WORK LOG.)
/E (THE SYSTEM CONTEXT DIAGRAM FOR THE MINUM'S ENT.  MANAGEMENT SYSTEM  SHOWS HOW THE SYSTEM INTERACTS WITH CUSTOMER, STAFF & MANAGER, AND GOOGLE GEMINI AI API AT THE HIGHER LEVEL. THE CUSTOMERS ARE ABLE TO LOG INTO THE MOBILE APP TO VIEW THE MENU, PLACE AN ORDER, TRACK THEIR ORDER ONLINE, AND ALSO SEND INQUIRIES THROUGH THE AI CHATBOT OR DIRECTLY TO MANAGERS. STAFF & MANAGER WILL BE INTERACTING WITH THE SYSTEM TO TAKE CARE OF THEIR ATTENDANCE, REGISTER STOCK-IN AND STOCK-OUT, EDIT MENU INFORMATION, AND VIEW REPORTS RELATED TO INVENTORY AND WORK LOG.)
