/E (The final deliverable of this project is THE MINUM'S ENT. System Management Application \(v1.0.0\), a fully functional cross-platform Android application that integrates customer ordering, staff attendance management, and inventory tracking into a single platform. Customers can register, log in, browse the food and beverage menu, check item availability, and place orders through the application. The application also includes a Google Gemini-powered AI chatbot to answer customer enquiries about menu prices, item availability, and kiosk services, with an option to contact the manager for further assistance when needed.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
